ru dokumentov Martin Olšovský, Štefan Meliš, Jozef Moravčík: Po stopách predkov, Archeológia Stredného Považia od praveku po stredovek - súbor dokumentov a fotografií, vydal vlastným nákladom Martin Olšovský v roku 2008 v počte 4 kusy.</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<br /></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\nBez odborného popisu je hodnota nálezov takpovediac polovičná, preto nám zostáva dúfať, že k odbornému publikovaniu nálezov dôjde čo najskôr.</div>\n"},"link":[{"rel":"replies","type":"application/atom+xml","href":"http://www.hradiska.sk/feeds/3761587008556304471/comments/default","title":"Zverejniť komentáre"},{"rel":"replies","type":"text/html","href":"http://www.hradiska.sk/2013/08/nalezy-z-hradiska-dolna-marikova.html#comment-form","title":"0 komentárov"},{"rel":"edit","type":"application/atom+xml","href":"http://www.blogger.com/feeds/6818054921907446479/posts/default/3761587008556304471"},{"rel":"self","type":"application/atom+xml","href":"http://www.blogger.com/feeds/6818054921907446479/posts/default/3761587008556304471"},{"rel":"alternate","type":"text/html","href":"http://www.hradiska.sk/2013/08/nalezy-z-hradiska-dolna-marikova.html","title":"Nálezy z hradiska Dolná Mariková  - Šimunky (Široká)"}],"author":[{"name":{"$t":"Unknown"},"email":{"$t":"noreply@blogger.com"},"gd$image":{"rel":"http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail","width":"16","height":"16","src":"https://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif"}}],"media$thumbnail":{"xmlns$media":"http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/","url":"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgcSwRg_nZpKwXdu4h5zbWxcm_tuGgsJqUUbB96GNXk6KlStqeuBukfe4keeAtCTQQnGT-5Xd_4GGSI6G3YIg4Q-7GmIsdZk3yxmcxpjzg20egNRuBs8dAjnQK-ERESP0eLjNvQE8btD2c/s72-c/1.jpg","height":"72","width":"72"},"thr$total":{"$t":"0"}}]}}